{
  "question": "Aik student ne 10 minute par do colored items ko dekhte hue kaha 'upar 5 aayega'. Phir, kareeb 12 minute par, usi tarah ke test mein jab aap ne 'kyun?' pucha, to ek student ne sahi jawab '3,7' diya lekin woh sirf numbers repeat karne laga. In do alag waqt par, aap ke nazdeek, unke sochne ka tareeka kya badal gaya tha?",
  "question_en": "At the 10-minute mark, a student said 'the top will be 5' when looking at two colored items. Then, near the 12-minute mark, in a similar test, when you asked 'why?' a student gave the correct answer '3,7' but started just repeating the numbers. At these two different times, in your view, what changed in their way of thinking?"
}
